WEEK 11 — FLASHCART POINTS (LOYALTY)

Date: Monday, 19 October 2026

Problem: A discount on the bill would lower the taxable value and change the GST already printed on the invoice.

Solution:
- Studied how GST applies to discounts and vouchers before writing code.
- Treated FlashCart points as a voucher, so the invoice total and GST stay the same.
- Reduced only the amount due, which is what goes to Razorpay or the cash desk.
- Capped redemption at 50% of the bill and at the customer's balance, checked on the server.
- Earned points only after payment, and logged every movement in a ledger table.
